<title>HONG KONG: CIBC CEF sets warrants on Cathay Pacific.</title>
<headline>CIBC CEF sets warrants on Cathay Pacific.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canadian Imperial Bank of Commerce's London Branch, said on Thursday it launched 150 million American-style call warrants on shares of Cathay Pacific</p>
<p>Airways Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	 HK$14.085     PREMIUM	 14.2 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	  HK$0.379	GEARING	 4.13x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	   26.JUN.98     MIN EXER LOT  10,000</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT     HK$15.65</p>
<p> LISTING		HONG KONG</p>
<p> NOTE		   PHYSICAL OR CASH SETTLEMENT AT ISSUER'S</p>
<p>			  DISCRETION</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
